    <!-- About -->
    <string name="nav_acerca">About</string>
    <string name="acerca_version">Version: 1.5 </string>
    <string name="app_desc">GeoMB shows Mexico City Metrobús units in real time: live map, search by unit number, lines, routes by code and arrival alerts by station.\n\nThis is a project solely for the responsible use of transit enthusiasts and for those who need to catch a unit.</string>
    <string name="agradecimientos_titulo">Acknowledgements</string>
    <string name="agradecimientos_texto">Thanks to Mexico City Metrobús and to SONDA for the GTFS-Realtime system that makes the live information possible. And to the community of users who help by identifying the units, their companies and models.\n\nProject developed by Abraham Gutiérrez — IPN. Instagram: @abr.gt1mb\nCo-author: Joshua Martinez — IPN. Instagram: @josmtz888 \n\nSpecial thanks:\n\n●Minami Aguilar. (Ideas to improve the map).\n●Manuel Lozano. (To whom I dedicate this project).\n●Augusto Neri. (Proposals for the Metrobús route system).\n●Dante Sifuentes. (Logo designer).\n●To all the operators I know who have supported me since before I was a known figure in the community.\n\nProject dedicated to everyone who has supported me since my beginnings in the public-transit enthusiast community, and dedicated to a figure who inspired me to keep going even when I didn\'t believe in myself, thank you, father.</string>
    <string name="acerca_datos">Arrival times are estimates. Data comes from the Metrobús feed and may vary. GeoMB is not officially affiliated with Mexico City Metrobús.</string>

    <!-- Ethical notice (gate) -->
    <string name="aviso_titulo">Responsible-use notice</string>
    <string name="aviso_texto">To use GeoMB you must accept these terms:\n\n• I will use the information only for mobility and informational purposes.\n• I will not use the data to track, harass or surveil people (operators or other users).\n• I understand that locations and arrival times are estimates and may not be exact.\n• I will not use the app for unauthorized commercial purposes or to harm the service.\n• I will respect privacy and applicable law.\n\nIf you do not accept, the app will close.</string>
    <string name="aviso_aceptar">I accept</string>
    <string name="aviso_rechazar">I don\'t accept</string>
    <string name="aviso_sec_uso">Responsible use</string>
    <string name="aviso_sec_privacidad">Privacy notice</string>
    <string name="aviso_sec_terminos">Terms of use</string>
    <string name="aviso_privacidad_texto">GeoMB handles your data as follows:\n\n• Google account (email, name and an identifier) to sign in, via Google Firebase.\n• Location: used on the device for the map, planner and arrival/trip alerts. Google Maps processes it to display the map. It is not shared with third parties for other purposes.\n• Push notifications via Firebase Cloud Messaging.\n• Issue reporting: to report, your identity is verified with a third-party provider (KYC) that processes your official ID and a facial photo under that provider\'s policy. The app stores ONLY your name and a device-linked \"verified\" flag; it does NOT store your ID or your face. Any evidence (photo, video or audio) you attach is sent from your own email to Metrobús.\n• We do not sell your data or show ads.\n\nYou can revoke permissions in system settings. Biometric data is sensitive personal data; by continuing you give your explicit consent for its processing by the verification provider for the sole purpose of enabling reporting.</string>
    <string name="aviso_terminos_texto">By using GeoMB you agree that:\n\n• It is an independent, informational app, with no official relationship to Metrobús or the Mexico City government.\n• Real-time data comes from public sources and are estimates; it may be inaccurate or unavailable. Provided \"as is\", without warranty.\n• You are responsible for the truthfulness of the reports you submit; false reports or misuse may have legal consequences and lead to access suspension.\n• You will not use the app to track, harass or surveil people, nor for unauthorized commercial purposes or to harm the service.\n• To the maximum extent permitted by law, the developers are not liable for damages arising from use of the app or the accuracy of the information.\n\nIf you do not accept, the app will close.</string>
    <string name="aviso_acepto_check">I have read and accept the responsible use, privacy notice and terms of use.</string>

